native-chat-template.v2.0.10.json contains a synthetic request captured from
the official @opencode/cli-darwin-arm64@2.0.10 package. Machine paths and
session identifiers have been replaced with synthetic diagnostic values.
The system prompt and tool schemas are derived from OpenCode.
minimal-text-profile.v1.json is an experimental reduced derivative of that
synthetic request. It does not provide filesystem access or execute tools.
balanced-text-profile.v2.json restores the public OpenCode introduction and
adds a short diagnostic instruction about following requests and copying
identifiers. It remains an experimental text-only compatibility profile.

